CONTROLBAR:IbmWatchRaptorPatrol
"Raptor &Patrol"
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmTooltipWatchRaptorPatrol
"Raptors watch the area for 45 seconds. Each enemy aircraft that enters is attacked by a Raptor (up to 4 passes)."
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmWatchA10Watch
"A-10 &Watch"
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmTooltipWatchA10Watch
"A-10s watch the area for 45 seconds. Enemy vehicles that enter are hit by an A-10's missiles and cannon (up to 2 passes)."
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmWatchMiGPatrol
"MiG &Patrol"
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmTooltipWatchMiGPatrol
"MiGs watch the area for 45 seconds. Each enemy aircraft that enters is attacked by a MiG (up to 4 passes)."
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmWatchMiGHunter
"MiG &Hunters"
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmTooltipWatchMiGHunter
"MiGs watch the area for 45 seconds. Enemy vehicles that enter are hit by a MiG's armour-piercing missiles (up to 3 passes)."
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmWatchStingerAmbush
"Stinger &Ambush"
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmTooltipWatchStingerAmbush
"Three hidden Stinger soldiers wait at the spot for 45 seconds and fire at enemy aircraft. Firing reveals them."
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmWatchRPGAmbush
"&RPG Ambush"
END

CONTROLBAR:IbmTooltipWatchRPGAmbush
"Four hidden RPG troopers wait at the spot for 45 seconds and fire at enemies in range. Firing reveals them."
END
